#
# [!] Mot dong o day KHONG co nghia la "da sua". No co nghia la "da doc, da can
#     nhac, va chap nhan trong hien tai". `check_cve.py` TU CHOI chay neu mot
#     dong thieu ly do -- mot danh sach mien tru khong ly do la mot danh sach
#     se dai ra ma khong ai nho vi sao.
#
# TRANG THAI DO DUOC 06/09/2026
#
# Co HAI con so, va chung khac nhau. Dung lan:
#
#   1. Quet SPEC (`-r requirements*.txt`) -- thu mot lan cai MOI se nhan.
#      Do la thu cong cu nay chot, vi no tai hien duoc tu kho tren may bat ky.
#
#   2. Quet VENV SAN PHAM -- rui ro DANG CHAY. Chi lam duoc tren may chu:
#
#        C:/LTTPlatform/venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pip freeze > <tep>
#        python -m pip_audit --no-deps -r <tep>
#
#      (`--no-deps` la bat buoc: mot freeze co `torch==...+cu128` khong giai
#      duoc tren PyPI, va thieu co nay pip-audit chet truoc khi kiem gi.)
#
#      Do 06/09 tren venv san pham:
#
#        pillow        11.3.0    25 advisory    ban va 12.1.1+
#        cryptography  46.0.7     6 advisory    ban va 48.0.1+
#        setuptools    78.1.0     4 advisory    ban va 78.1.1   <- KHONG bi tran chan
#        click          8.2.1     1 advisory    ban va 8.3.3
#        sqladmin      0.20.1     1 advisory    ban va 0.25.1
#
# [!] BA VIEC CON NO CHU DU AN -- khong phai viec cong cu nay tu lam, vi ca ba
#     deu la NANG PHU THUOC SAN PHAM tren mot may dang chay that:
#
#       pillow       25 advisory, va no nam tren duong xu ly ANH NGUOI DUNG
#                    TAI LEN. Uu tien cao nhat trong ba.
#       cryptography  6 advisory, thu vien ma hoa token.
#       setuptools    4 advisory, ban va la 78.1.0 -> 78.1.1: VA VAT, khong bi
#                    tran nao chan. Re nhat de dong.

